</span></code></pre></div></div>
      <h5 id="metadata">
        
        
          metadata <a href="#metadata" class="anchorClass"></a>
        
        
      </h5>
    

<p>An ordered list of descriptions to be displayed to the user when they interact with the resource, given as pairs of human readable <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">label</code> and <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">value</code> entries. The content of these entries is intended for presentation only; descriptive semantics <em class="rfc">should not</em> be inferred. An entry might be used to convey information about the creation of the object, a physical description, ownership information, or other purposes.</p>

<p>The value of the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">metadata</code> property <em class="rfc">must</em> be an array of <abbr title="JavaScript Object Notation">JSON</abbr> objects, where each item in the array has both <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">label</code> and <code class="language-plaintext highlight